---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Kyle Cheek and Cristian Velez are DFW-born licensed Texas Realtors helping families navigate inherited property through Whitecap Estates.">

  <section class="page-hero navy-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label" style="color: var(--accent-light);">Who We Are</span>
      <h1>Local Realtors. Local Investors. Born and Raised in DFW.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div class="about-main">
        <span class="section-label">Our Story</span>
        <h2>We Started Whitecap Estates Because We Saw How Families Were Being Treated</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>When a family goes through probate, they're dealing with grief, legal complexity, and a property they didn't plan for. The last thing they need is a flood of form letters from investors they've never met, offering lowball numbers and pressuring them to sign fast.</p>
        <p>We're a small local team based in Plano. Our founders grew up in Rockwall and McKinney. We're both licensed Texas Realtors who have spent our careers in the DFW market. We know these neighborhoods because we've lived in them.</p>
        <p>Whitecap Estates was built around a simple idea: come in as a resource first and a buyer second. We'll tell you honestly what your options are, what the property is worth, and what the probate process looks like in Texas. If a cash offer makes sense for your family, we'll make a fair one. If listing on the market is a better move, we'll help you do that too. The goal is the right outcome for you, not a fast close for us.</p>
        <p>We focus on North DFW, covering Frisco, Allen, McKinney, Richardson, Carrollton, and the surrounding communities. This is our backyard. We're not running a national operation from a call center. We're a local team that takes pride in doing this the right way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-sidebar">
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-head">
            <div class="team-photo-placeholder">KC</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Kyle Cheek</h3>
              <p class="team-role">Licensed Texas Realtor</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="team-bio">Born and raised in Rockwall, TX. Kyle has 10+ years in DFW real estate and specializes in probate, inherited property, and complex transactions.</p>
          <div class="team-tags">
            <span>Probate</span>
            <span>Inherited Property</span>
            <span>Listings</span>
          </div>
          <div class="team-contact">
            <a href="tel:4693585646">(469) 358-5646</a>
            <a href="mailto:kyle@whitecap-holdings.com">kyle@whitecap-holdings.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-head">
            <div class="team-photo-placeholder">CV</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Cristian Velez</h3>
              <p class="team-role">Licensed Texas Realtor</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="team-bio">Born in Plano and raised in McKinney. A Texas Tech finance graduate, Cristian spent two years in real estate investment before earning his Texas Realtor license in 2025. He has been directly involved in 100+ off-market transactions through Whitecap Estates and evaluates every property the way an investor would. He works with buyers, sellers, and investors across DFW, including probate and inherited property.</p>
          <div class="team-tags">
            <span>Probate</span>
            <span>Off-Market</span>
            <span>Value-Add Resale</span>
          </div>
          <p class="team-license">Texas Realtor License #0833260 | Corey Simpson &amp; Associates</p>
          <div class="team-contact">
            <a href="tel:9453499179">(945) 349-9179</a>
            <a href="mailto:cris@whitecap-holdings.com">cris@whitecap-holdings.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="off-white-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="section-label">Our Approach</span>
        <h2>Resource First. Buyer Second.</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">&#9673;</div>
          <h4>No Pressure</h4>
          <p>You move on your timeline, not ours. Probate takes time and so does good decision-making. We're here when you're ready.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">&#9673;</div>
          <h4>Plain English</h4>
          <p>No legal jargon, no confusing paperwork. I'll explain every step of the process in terms that actually make sense.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">&#9673;</div>
          <h4>Real Options</h4>
          <p>Cash offer or market listing, we do both. You get to choose what's right for your situation, not what's right for our bottom line.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">&#9673;</div>
          <h4>Local Knowledge</h4>
          <p>We know North DFW neighborhoods because we grew up here and have been investing here for years. No guesswork on valuations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="text-center">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 600px;">
      <h2>Ready to Talk?</h2>
      <p>Book a free call and tell us what you're dealing with. No pitch, no pressure. Just an honest conversation.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 24px;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Free Call</a>
        <a href="/probate-resources" class="btn btn-outline-navy">Browse Resources</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
.page-hero {
  padding: 72px 24px 64px;
}

.page-hero h1 {
  color: var(--white);
  max-width: 680px;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.about-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
  gap: 64px;
  align-items: start;
}

.about-main h2 { margin-top: 8px; }

.team-card {
  background: var(--off-white);
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-light);
  border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--border-radius);
  padding: 28px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.team-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.team-photo-placeholder {
  flex: 0 0 64px;
  width: 64px;
  height: 64px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.team-card h3 { margin: 0 0 2px; }

.team-role {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin: 0;
}

.team-bio {
  font-size: 0.93rem;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.team-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.team-tags span {
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-light);
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
}

.team-license {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--gray-text);
  margin: -6px 0 16px;
}

.team-contact {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-light);
  padding-top: 16px;
}

.team-contact a {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.team-contact a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

.values-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 32px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.value-item { text-align: center; }

.value-icon {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.value-item h4 { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.value-item p { font-size: 0.9rem; }

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  .values-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
